            "richTextValue" : "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 36px;\">About Me</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">In four years of experience in a company that dedicates to telecommunications, I have had to be versatile moving in different areas of systems engineering. The goal is to find solutions for clients, whether in IT, database, or coding.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">In addition to my daily work, I also give technical support to local import-export businesses where I update old servers and leave them with the most recent versions of Windows Server.&nbsp;</span></p>"
